Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Like Moses had four chapters, like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I have. Contrary to popular belief,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}モーゼに4つの章があったように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺にもある
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.73,0:00:07.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I did read the four
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.73,0:00:07.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}chapters of Moses, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.73,0:00:07.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}意外かもしれないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.73,0:00:07.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}モーゼの4章は読んだぜ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.69,0:00:08.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You say you ain't read something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.69,0:00:08.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}何か読んでないって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.69,0:00:08.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}言ってたよな？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}No, what I'm saying, yeah, I've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}never actually finished a novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}そう、つまり　小説を最後まで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}読んだことは一度もない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.25,0:00:14.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Right. That's fantastic. I respect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.25,0:00:14.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}なるほど　最高じゃん　リスペクトするわ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:16.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah, because by the way, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:16.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}それにさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:19.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}one thing is that there's nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:19.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}whiter than English itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:19.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}英語ほど白人的なものは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:19.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ないからな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:25.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I do not like to read, like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:25.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I do not like to work out,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:25.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}読むのは好きじゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.15,0:00:27.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}like I do not like, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.15,0:00:27.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}筋トレも好きじゃないのと同じで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:33.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}there's certain stuff in life that is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:33.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}currently necessary that I don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:33.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}人生には必要だけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:33.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}好きじゃないことってあるだろ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:38.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That don't make... I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:38.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}not disregarding people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:38.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}だからって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:38.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}人を軽く見てるわけじゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:39.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Some people are more...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:39.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}得意不得意があるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:41.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}How many people do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:41.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}you know that can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:41.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}本はよく読めるけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:43.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}read very well that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:43.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}can't dance very well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:43.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ダンスはダメな奴って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:43.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}どれだけいる？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:44.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But see, look
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:44.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}でもさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}talking about articulation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}言葉の話で言うと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:49.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}could it be said that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:49.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}it's misunderstood that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:49.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「読書＝知識」っていうのは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:52.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}reading equals knowledge?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:52.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}That's another thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:52.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}誤解だとも言えるよな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:56.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Because you don't have to read
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:56.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}books to really have knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:56.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}本を読まなくても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:56.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}知識は持てるからな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:00:57.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:00:57.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}その通り
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.13,0:01:03.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And if... and the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.13,0:01:03.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}information isn't there...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.13,0:01:03.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}それに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.13,0:01:03.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}情報がそこにない時
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.27,0:01:06.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know where the information,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.27,0:01:06.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}the knowledge is from?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.27,0:01:06.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}知識がどこから来るか
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.27,0:01:06.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}わかるか？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.51,0:01:09.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}The knowledge is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.51,0:01:09.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}from the two fathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.51,0:01:09.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}知識は
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.51,0:01:09.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}二人の父から来るんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.27,0:01:10.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Who are the two fathers?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.27,0:01:10.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}二人の父って誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:11.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:11.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}教えてくれよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.87,0:01:13.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Your father and the Father above.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.87,0:01:13.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}自分の父親と
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.89,0:01:16.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Your father and the Father above.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.89,0:01:16.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}天にいる父だよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:20.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Now what, now what has
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:20.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}happened to the black community?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:20.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}じゃあ黒人社会に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:20.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}何が起きたか？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.23,0:01:21.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}They erased the father.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.23,0:01:21.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}父親を消されたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.75,0:01:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So all you have is the Father above,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.75,0:01:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}だから残ってるのは
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.75,0:01:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}天の父だけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:25.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}but they've erased that, even that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:25.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}でもそれすら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:25.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}消されてきた
